  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A standing wave is formed between two loudspeakers that emit sound waves of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>A student walking between the two loudspeakers finds that the distance between two consecutive sound maxima is 1.5 m. The speed of sound is 300 m s<sup>−1</sup>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">400 Hz</li><li data-label=\"B\">200 Hz</li><li data-label=\"C\">100 Hz</li><li data-label=\"D\">50 Hz</li></ol>"
  },
